flowchart TB
  accTitle: From one Zellij pane to three
  accDescr: Split a pane downward, focus the lower pane, and split it to the right to make three panes. Follow the current status-bar hints for pane mode and actions so session controls are not confused with pane controls.

hints["Read the bottom status bar<br/>Choose pane mode and an available action"]
  one["Start with one pane<br/>Keep the current task running"]
  down["Split downward"]
  two["Two panes<br/>Original task above, new terminal below"]
  focus["Move focus to the lower pane"]
  right["Split the lower pane to the right"]
  three["Three independent panes"]
  task["Upper pane<br/>Keep the original task"]
  lowerLeft["Lower left pane<br/>Run a monitoring command"]
  lowerRight["Lower right pane<br/>Run another terminal program"]
  hints --> one --> down --> two --> focus --> right --> three
  three --> task
  three --> lowerLeft
  three --> lowerRight
